			"Message": "style(Sky): Use em-quad spacing between heading text and emoji\n\nReplace the regular space before the sun emoji in the README title with an em-quad (U+2001) space, matching the CodeEditorLand convention for consistent heading formatting across Land project documentation.\n\nNo functional change.",
